E&s=b89bb5e4de16bcfedaca36b9e9725ccf", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2222468, "client_id": 1231709, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 49, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@takapachi_com/works/35", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2222468, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7b51b1b9/uploads/origins/4744ee84-1a32-4845-acd6-5ec4b331319c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b87afc174b228e9b108bad5f5baa5ae9", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7b51b1b9/uploads/origins/4744ee84-1a32-4845-acd6-5ec4b331319c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=20ac124a66d503476b5cc9458317046c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "初めて依頼をさせて頂きます。\n\nキャラクター:ウマ娘のヴィルシーナ\n\nシチュエーション:資料の様なヤンデレぽい表情で手を引いている感じでお願いします。服装はトレセン学園の冬服でお願いします。\n\n\nどうかよろしくお願い致します(ﾉ_ _)ﾉ\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/91042400", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takapachi_com/works/34", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/55c183f7/uploads/origins/27576eed-9b66-436f-b0a4-be0b7b4b50ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8f9d9dc8010c5e7684d2fb29f4da0a0e", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2222468, "client_id": 2936438, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@takapachi_com/works/33", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2222468, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7b5d406/uploads/origins/fbbbff8e-ae8f-4ce1-beb4-c70222670c15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e0180c5a3c684282df07aaec8789f0b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7b5d406/uploads/origins/fbbbff8e-ae8f-4ce1-beb4-c70222670c15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=69dec38794af62e1f9da5886e8874d5b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんばんは、たかぱち.jp様のモノクロイラストが大変大好きです！\n\n少し変わったシチュエーションの依頼になりますが、極寒の南極で“人間の観測した世界で一番寒い気温”にチャレンジする、毛皮の防寒着でモッフモフに着膨れしたダイワスカーレットちゃんをお願いします\n指定や情報量等、難しい場合は遠慮なくキャンセルして頂いて大丈夫です。\n\n世界一寒い気温を計測しようと猛吹雪の中、ひたすらに分厚い防寒着を何枚も着込みながら、吹雪の中で寒さに耐え続けている。\nと言うシチュエーションをお願いしたいです\n\n服装はモフモフした毛皮の防寒着、毛皮のケープやモフモフの大きなファーマフラー等を着込み、分厚いミトンの手袋やブーツなど、北国風の防寒着を頭から足まで露出無く着込んでいるイメージです\n\nとにかく寒さから身を守るためにモフモフに着込みまくったような、着込ませ過ぎだと思うその8割増しくらいのモフモフ着膨れ加減でお願いしたいです\n\n呼気は凍って顔周りはガチガチに凍り、髪の毛やマフラー、まつ毛等にも霜やつららが出来、防寒着も霜とつららでガチガチになっています\n想像以上の寒さにガタガタと震えるも、防寒着を抱き締めて耐え、リアイアを促されるも、口からマフラーに染み込む程につららを垂らしながら、雪だるまのようになりながらガチガチに凍える様子をお願いしたいです\n\n最終的に足元の気温計は−89.4°Cを示し、防寒着はガチガチに凍って震え、見るからに限界なほど寒そうな様子をお願いします。\n\nまた、“地球で一番低い気温”を狙ってさらに延長し、さらに気温が下がり、防寒着は完全に真っ白な霜やつららに包まれ、マフラーを鼻まで覆い、目以外の露出無しでつららや霜でガチガチになっている姿もお願いできると嬉しいです", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takapachi_com/works/32", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2222468, "client_id": 1019308, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1db13594/uploads/origins/b79057d0-cdf7-40cc-8103-f297165f4157?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d127d52108c6db35de54c9eabb305cc6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1db13594/uploads/origins/b79057d0-cdf7-40cc-8103-f297165f4157?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f930cc0fdbdf45fba334fdde2def23eb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello Takapachi!\n\nI would like to request a drawing about this character:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/cBXUqff\nNewspaper-chan (新聞ちゃん) from Tawawa on Monday (月曜日のたわわ) [chapter 83]\n\nNewspaper-chan is wearing a white sports bra and black shorts. Her cup size is E-cup. She is wiping her sweat off with a towel. The illustration is from the point of view of her male colleague. Newspaper-chan is looking back at him.\n\nThank you very much for your attention! I hope I was understandable. My apologies for not using DeepL, but I had issues in the past with it.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takapachi_com/works/31", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b7b7539/uploads/origins/a21a6a41-1422-43be-beb0-06532d3a6e53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c974f522c5c607d77e581dcc2929596e", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2222468, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@takapachi_com/works/30", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e403993c/uploads/origins/f04cc37b-986b-4eff-a532-8b18efb8beef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=